        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ashton Town A.F.C., Cheshire Association Football League\n- Places: Edge Green Street, Ashton-in-Makerfield town centre\n- Competitions: Cheshire League Premier Division, Divisions One and Two, Reserve Division\n\nFacts:\n- From the 2017–18 season, the Cheshire Association Football League has operated four divisions: the Premier Division, Divisions One and Two, and a Reserve Division.\n- Ashton Town A.F.C. are currently members of the Cheshire League Premier Division.\n- Ashton Town A.F.C. play at Edge Green Street, which is one mile north-east of the Ashton-in-Makerfield town centre.",
